## Summary

Implemented per-module tutor chat history hydration, debounced autosave, and a Clear history control in `LessonChat`.

**Changes:**
- **`src/components/LessonChat.tsx`** — new optional `moduleId` prop; `ChatMessage` gained `createdAt?` + `hydrated?`. On open it hydrates the transcript via `GET /api/chats/<course>/<module>`; completed turns autosave via a debounced `PUT` (gated on `!sending`, so never per-token); a Clear history button with an inline confirm step empties the view and `DELETE`s the file. Hydrated messages render but are **excluded from the history window sent to `/api/lesson-chat`**, so persistence never grows the prompt.
- **`src/lib/server/chatHistory.ts`** — `clearChatHistory()` (unlink, ENOENT = success).
- **`src/app/api/chats/[courseSlug]/[moduleId]/route.ts`** — `DELETE` handler (204 / 400 on unsafe slug).
- **lesson `page.tsx`** — passes `moduleId={lesson?.moduleId}`.
- Tests added to both `chatHistory.test.ts` (DELETE) and `LessonChat.test.tsx` (hydration + Clear flows).

**Verification:**
- Typecheck: passes.
- Tests: 27/27 on the touched files; full suite green except 2 pre-existing flaky `generation.test.ts` cases (pass in isolation — parallel `/tmp` contention, unrelated).
- Lint: zero new problems vs. baseline.
- Browser (playwright, 11/12): hydration on open, same-module nav shows the same conversation, other-module shows its own (not M1's), Clear-with-confirm empties view + store, and clear is module-scoped (M1 untouched). The 1 "fail" is false-positive console noise from a pre-existing `/regenerate/status` 404, not chat-related.

Two design calls worth flagging (also in progress.txt): hydrated history is shown but kept out of the prompt to honor "persystencja nie zwiększa rozmiaru promptu"; and autosave waits on a separate `loadedKeyRef` (set after the GET resolves) so an empty list can't be PUT over the store mid-load.
